WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
If you take iron supplements, or a multivitamin that contains iron, please stop taking them

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.680
about one week before your procedure.

3
00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:11.880
Iron can interfere with your bowel prep and make it harder to see clearly during the colonoscopy.

4
00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:16.880
Check your multivitamin label too, as many contain iron even if it's not obvious.

5
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:21.240
If you're unsure whether a specific supplement is okay to continue, reach out to your doctor's

6
00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.000
office before making any changes.
